DSpark model and configuration provenance

The original config.py and model.py imported into this branch at
eea6f8194828dda88186277312527a36c131367a match byte-for-byte:
https://github.com/ARahim3/mlx-dspark/tree/9e39ea2fdc6d99d855af2cb7ef9933391c4391db/src/mlx_dspark

The loader.py implementation adapts that project's load.py to vllm-metal's
model lifecycle. Subsequent validation, loading and integration changes are
maintained in this repository. The source is an independent MLX implementation;
DeepSeek-AI/DeepSpec is the official numerical reference.

